    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">内容</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Alleyne:_The_Fighting_Master\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">阿莱茵：战斗大师</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Strategy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">策略</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Vs._Alleyne\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">对战阿莱茵</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Overall_Judgement\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">总体评价</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alleyne:_The_Fighting_Master\">阿莱茵：战斗大师</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAlleyne_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>BP<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/13/Alleyne_GB.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130604225815\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Alleyne GB\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/13/Alleyne_GB.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130604225815\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"254\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Alleyne GB.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Alleyne_GB.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Alleyne_GB.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>: 12</li>\n<li>身高：4</li>\n<li>攻击：1</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Alleyne\" title=\"Alleyne\">阿莱茵</a>她的称号绝非儿戏。凭借她的长棍，你会发誓它能同时击中所有可能的位置，而她名不虚传的「杀戮技巧」，让阿莱茵成为一名极具攻击性的战士，用巨大的压力压制对手的选择，然后真正意义上地终结他们。\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Strategy\">策略</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAlleyne_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/d6/Alleyne_34.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130604232909\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Alleyne 34\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/d6/Alleyne_34.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130604232909\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"243\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Alleyne 34.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Alleyne_34.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Alleyne_34.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>阿莱茵超乎想象地强。她拥有你至今所期待的各种细节和要领。她的招式包括挥击、突刺和佯攻，长棍甚至能破坏盾牌和其他武器。她还具备类似盾牌的格挡攻击，而得益于她的流星锤，她还能提供远程攻击选项，用来绊倒敌人，迫使他们跳跃躲避。这引出了阿莱茵最主要且压倒性的特色：她的「致命技巧」。与其他角色的「安全但较弱攻击」不同，她将最强攻击设置为(+3和+4加成丰富！)，而且由于这些攻击的特性，她能持续使用！(龙卷风击仅限绿和黄，+2加成；飓风怒更佳，无限制且+2加成；鹰爪是她的终结技，仅限绿和黄，但强制造成倒地状态)\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/20/Alleyne_29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130604231935\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Alleyne 29\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/20/Alleyne_29.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130604231935\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"242\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Alleyne 29.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Alleyne_29.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Alleyne_29.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>我无法再强调这三个招式有多强大。以至于由于系统对这些攻击的计算方式，反击几乎都不是一个选项！再加上其中两个能无限制地连续使用，在它们已拥有的强大基础加成之上保持巨大的+2加成，一旦她启动那可怕的致命技巧，你就能感受到她带来的压倒性压力。更糟糕的是，她还拥有「基础」的延长闪避和治疗选项，以防你从那种疯狂中击中她一两次！这甚至还没算上她的其他选项，这些扎实且强力的选项，为她提供了应对一切不受她特色影响的工具！\n\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Vs._Alleyne\">对战阿莱茵</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAlleyne_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/95/Alleyne_13.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130604231735\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Alleyne 13\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"242\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Alleyne 13.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Alleyne_13.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/95/Alleyne_13.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130604231735\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/95/Alleyne_13.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130604231735\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Alleyne 13\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/95/Alleyne_13.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130604231735\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"242\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Alleyne 13.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Alleyne_13.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/95/Alleyne_13.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130604231735\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Alleyne_13.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>……哈哈哈……这个，这个玩笑很有趣。当真吗？你手头真的只有几个微小的选择。如果阿莱茵开始挥舞她的杀招，你只能躲避，并希望借此能有机会转身/背后攻击，否则就祈祷你用的是带盾的角色，只能用自己的‘安全/盾攻击’来对付她。除此之外，你只能希望自己能否成功击倒或伤到手臂，造成足够伤害触发‘暴击’来瘫痪她。封锁她的杀招几乎是你唯一能突破她那近乎‘无懈可击的防御’的方法，否则你就是在玩一场由她主导的游戏，而你几乎24/7处于防守。你也可以尝试卸除她的武器，但这本身就很棘手……\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overall_Judgement\">总体评价</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAlleyne_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/ae/2P_ALLEYNE.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130604225849\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"2P ALLEYNE\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"255\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"2P ALLEYNE.jpg\" data-image-key=\"2P_ALLEYNE.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/ae/2P_ALLEYNE.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130604225849\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/ae/2P_ALLEYNE.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130604225849\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"2P ALLEYNE\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/ae/2P_ALLEYNE.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130604225849\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"255\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"2P ALLEYNE.jpg\" data-image-key=\"2P_ALLEYNE.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/ae/2P_ALLEYNE.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130604225849\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:2P_ALLEYNE.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>阿莱茵强得烦人。她的招式让她可以为所欲为，做任何想做的事或需要做的事，给了她滥用这些招式的优势，更别提这些攻击的特性，她使用这些招式时相当安全，几乎没有太多被惩罚的空间！用她赢简直无脑简单，就是‘随便赢’。最糟的部分是她可能有的‘缺点’都被她的所有选择和她杀招的变态强度所抵消。即使你试图硬抗，她能破你的盾，你试图躲避，她仍有所有选择来回应，功能不减。即使你试图拉长距离，你只会让她回复，滥用她的远距离旋风斩和绊索！如果在《女皇之刃》中有一个角色高喊‘超模’，阿莱茵就是那个角色。\n\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>技能等级：新手</b>  (甚至更低)</li>\n<li><b>等级：S</b> (+++++++++++++)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260821131124\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 16/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:27204-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260821131124 and revision id 63231. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
